# COBIT-Chainâ„¢ / AssuranceLayerâ„¢ Platform A
# Module: RLTTrustâ„¢ / IRLT Commercial Readiness Governance Command Centerâ„¢
# Feature: Pilot Readiness & ROI Justification Engineâ„¢
# Purpose: Convert RLTTrustâ„¢ into a practical pilot proposal with scope,
#          phases, evidence inputs, success metrics, ROI justification,
#          buyer value, and executive decision narrative.
# AI is advisory only. Human governance remains authoritative.
